  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat sesame oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add the sliced scallions and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Add the cooked rice to the skillet and stir to combine with the garlic and scallions.",
    "Add the soy sauce and fish seasoning to the rice and stir-fry for 2-3 minutes.",
    "Flake the cooked cod into the rice mixture and stir-fry for an additional minute.",
    "Season the dish with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Transfer the Kissed by Midnight Slovakian Fish Fried-Rice to a serving platter.",
    "Garnish with additional scallions if desired.",
    "Serve immediately."
